<title>USA: Most U.S. debt futures end unchanged.</title>
<headline>Most U.S. debt futures end unchanged.</headline>
<text>
<p>Feb 11 - Most U.S. debt futures ended unchanged in extremely light trade. Some traders said Fed McDonough's comments that the U.S. economy was operating close to capacity helped push March bonds to the daily low of 112-12/32. Rubin said the dollar's fall has now corrected itself to a normal mode.</p>
<p>((DerivativesDesk(312)408-8750/E-mail:derivatives@reuters.com))</p>
